i-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Elf_Commoner</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Elf_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Elf_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Delyarna</b> is concerned about crime and house prices in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Delyarna.png/70px-Portrait_Delyarna.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Delyarna.png/105px-Portrait_Delyarna.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Delyarna.png/140px-Portrait_Delyarna.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Delyarna.png/70px-Portrait_Delyarna.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Delyarna.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Move along! Nothing to see here! At least by day, thank the gods.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Delyarna</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>Delyarna and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pompton_Norvath\" title=\"Pompton Norvath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Pompton_Norvath.png/25px-Portrait_Pompton_Norvath.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Pompton_Norvath.png/38px-Portrait_Pompton_Norvath.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Pompton_Norvath.png/50px-Portrait_Pompton_Norvath.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pompton Norvath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Pompton_Norvath.png/25px-Portrait_Pompton_Norvath.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Portrait_Pompton_Norvath.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pompton_Norvath\" title=\"Pompton Norvath\">Pompton Norvath</a> are two <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> neighbours discussing a nearby abandoned house.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Idle_banter\">Idle banter</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Delyarna</dt><dd>D'you hear those noises coming out of the old Albright place?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Pompton Norvath</dt><dd>Louder than foxes, and all through the night!</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Delyarna</dt><dd>You know what it is, don't you? <i>Criminals.</i></dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Pompton Norvath</dt><dd>Opportunists, the lot of them. And not a thought for their neighbours.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Pompton Norvath</dt><dd>What do you think happened to the Albrights anyway?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Delyarna</dt><dd>Buggered off because of the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a>, didn't they? Stupid of 'em, if you ask me - it's much safer this side of the city walls.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Pompton Norvath</dt><dd>Should've at least locked the place up proper before they left.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Delyarna</dt><dd>Imagine what it's done to the house prices!</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Pompton Norvath</dt><dd>I'd never let the kids play out in the streets now.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Delyarna</dt><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Lord Gortash</a> needs to send the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watch</a> through here, mop up all this riffraff. Gods, I think even they'd have their work cut out for 'em.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715031050\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.256 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.270 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7001/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50596/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12400/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 36527/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.078/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1726195/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  25